From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:54:55 +0100
Subject: Expect the bcmath warning before the result in the bug78878 test

0111-Fix-tests.patch changed the expected output to the one seen on
Windows. The warning of libbcmath goes to stderr while bcpowmod() runs, so
it comes before the result here, as the test added by
0106-Fix-78878-Buffer-underflow-in-bc_shift_addsub.patch expected.
---
 ext/bcmath/tests/bug78878.phpt | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ext/bcmath/tests/bug78878.phpt b/ext/bcmath/tests/bug78878.phpt
index 3337270..2c9d72b 100644
--- a/ext/bcmath/tests/bug78878.phpt
+++ b/ext/bcmath/tests/bug78878.phpt
@@ -9,4 +9,5 @@ if (!extension_loaded('bcmath')) die('skip bcmath extension not available');
 print @bcmul("\xB26483605105519922841849335928742092", bcpowmod(2, 65535, -4e-4));
 ?>
 --EXPECT--
-0bc math warning: non-zero scale in modulus
+bc math warning: non-zero scale in modulus
+0
